    categories: ["conflitti"],
    title: "Moscow accuses Estonia of hostile actions on ‘verge of triggering open war’",
    summary: "Estonia plans to close its border with Russia for at least six months after accusing Russian security services of staging an attempted arson attack.",
    preview: "Moscow – Russia’s Foreign Ministry on Monday accused Estonia, a NATO and European Union member state, of a range of hostile actions “on the verge of triggering open war,“ ratcheting up its rhetoric after Estonia announced the closure of their land border. Estonia plans to close border crossings with Russia from Dec. 1 for at least six months after accusing Russian security services of staging an attempted arson attack on an Estonian defense company. Russia denied involvement in the attack.",
    body: "Moscow – Russia’s Foreign Ministry on Monday accused Estonia, a NATO and European Union member state, of a range of hostile actions “on the verge of triggering open war,“ ratcheting up its rhetoric after Estonia announced the closure of their land border.\n\nEstonia plans to close border crossings with Russia from Dec. 1 for at least six months after accusing Russian security services of staging an attempted arson attack on an Estonian defense company. Russia denied involvement in the attack.\n\nThe Russian ministry set out its accusations in a statement after summoning Estonia’s charge d’affaires in Moscow to issue a formal protest over Tallinn’s decision to close the border.",
